#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To play patience you need, as the name suggests, patience. For simple games, "
"where the way the game goes depends only upon how the cards fall, your "
"patience might be the only thing you need."
msgstr ""
"Da bi igrali pasijans trebate, kao što ime sugerira, strpljenje. Za "
"jednostavne igre, gdje tok igre ovisi samo o tome kako su karte izvučene, "
"vaša strpljivost može biti sve što je potrebno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are also patience games where you must plan your strategy and think "
"ahead in order to win."
msgstr ""
"Postoje također pasijansi gdje je neophodno imati strategiju i razmišljati "
"unaprijed da bi se pobijedilo."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A theme common to all the games is the player must put the cards in a "
"special order &mdash; moving, turning and reordering them."
msgstr ""
"Zajednička osobina svih igara je da igrač mora redati karte posebnim "
"redoslijedom &mdash; micanje, okretanje i sređivanje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to Play"
msgstr "Kako igrati"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Objective:"
msgstr "Cilj:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rearrange the cards by suit in as few moves as possible."
msgstr "Prerasporediti karte po bojama u što je moguće manje poteza."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As &kappname; offers you a multiplicity of different solitaire games, there "
"is no straightforward how-to which could fit all of them. Therefore, it is "
"essential that you read each individual subsection of Game Rules, Strategies "
"and Tips section before you start playing a version you are not familiar "
"with."
msgstr ""
"Kako vam &kappname; nudi mnoštvo različitih pasijans igara, ne postoji "
"jednostavan način uputstva koji bi odgovarao svima. Dakle, bitno je da ste "
"pročitali svako pojedinačno pravilo igre, strategije i savjete prije početka "
"igranja verziju s kojom niste upoznati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Essentially there are two types of solitaire games – the ones that let you "
"arrange the cards by same color and the ones that let you arrange the cards "
"by alternating color. You can easily determine which game you are trying out "
"using trial-and-error method. Once you know which one you are dealing with "
"the rest is easy; keep arranging and rearranging the cards and collecting "
"the matching ones."
msgstr ""
"U osnovi postoje dvije vrste igara pasijansa - one koje vam izbace karte "
"iste boje i one koje vam izbace karte različitih boja. Možete jednostavno "
"odrediti šta igrati metodom pokušaja i pogreške. Jednom kada znate šta "
"igrate ostatak je lahak; nastavite slagati i prebacivati karte te praviti "
"što više podudaranja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the beginning, however, pay attention to your card stacks. Do not rush "
"to move individual cards around. See if it might be more useful elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Na samom početku, međutim, obratite pažnju na svoje špilove. Ne žurite sa "
"micanjem karata bilo gdje. Pogledajte šta je korisno odigrati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For additional help you can also take quick peeks onto the statusbar. Each "
"of the games has a built in solver which informs you whether the game you "
"are currently playing can be completed or not. If you see that solver could "
"not complete the current game, chances are you will not be able to do so as "
"well. At this point you can either restart the current game, or start a "
"completely new game."
msgstr ""
"Za dodatnu pomoć možete brzo baciti pogled na status traku. Svaka od igara "
"ima ugrađen Razrješivač koji vas obavještava da li igru koju trenutno igrate "
"možete dovršiti ili ne. Ako vidite da razrješivač nije mogao završiti "
"trenutnu igru, šanse su da nećete biti u mogućnosti da učiniti isto. U ovom "
"trenutku možete ili ponovno pokrenuti trenutnu igru ili započeti sasvim novu "
"igru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Bilješka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Playing solitaire games helps you to greatly improve your attention span and "
"enhance the ability to concentrate."
msgstr ""
"Igranje pasijansa vam uveliko pomaže da unaprijedite nivo pažnje i poboljša "
"koncentraciju."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Rules, Strategies and Tips"
msgstr "Pravila igre, Strategije i Savjeti"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Rules"
msgstr "Opšta Pravila"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "suits"
msgstr "boje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A card game contains one or more card decks of 52 cards each. Each deck "
"contains the four suits:"
msgstr ""
"Igra karata sadrži jedan ili više špilova od 52 karte u svakom. Svaki špil "
"sadrži četiri boje:"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clubs"
msgstr "Trefovi"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "Spades"
msgstr "Pikovi"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hearts"
msgstr "Srca"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid "Diamonds"
msgstr "Karoni"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each of these suits contains the following card types: ace, two, three, "
"four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten, jack, queen, and king."
msgstr ""
"Svaka od boja sadrži sljedeće tipove karata: as, dva, tri, četiri, pet, "
"šest, sedam, osam, devet, deset, žandar, kraljica i kralj."

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "family"
msgstr "niz"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This complete order of cards is called a family. There are real families and "
"alternating ones. The real families are all of one suit (&eg; Hearts). In "
"the alternating families the card color changes from one to another, between "
"a black color (Clubs and Spades) and a red color (Hearts and Diamonds)."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj potpuni redoslijed karata se zove niz. Postoje pravi nizovi i "
"naizmjenični nizovi. Pravi nizovi su svi u jednoj boji (&eg; Srca). U "
"naizmjeničnim nizovima se mijenja boja karte iz jedne u drugu, između crnih "
"boja (Trefovi i Pikovi) i crvenih boja (Srca i Karona)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid "If the family is not complete it is called a sequence."
msgstr "Ako niz nije potpun to se zove sekvenca."

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "The game field of &kpatience;"
msgstr "Prostor igre &kpatience;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are a number of features found in typical patience games. These are "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"Postoje i broj određenih odlika tipičnih pasijans igara. One su opisane "
"ispod."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "1. Talon"
msgstr "1. Stub"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "talon"
msgstr "stub"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the beginning of each game all cards are mixed in the deck. In some games "
"not all cards are dealt out. The remaining cards are put down on the talon "
"(also called the stock). You can find this quite easily, since in most games "
"it is the only pile in which all cards are face down."
msgstr ""
"Na početku svake igre sve karte su izmješane u špilu. U nekim igrama ne "
"djele se sve karte. Ostale karte se spuste na stub (također se naziva "
"lager). Možete smatrati ovo vrlo lahkim, jer u većini igara to je samo "
"kamara u kojoj su sve karte okrenute licem prema dolje."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "2. Waste Pile"
msgstr "2. Rasipati kamaru"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid "waste pile"
msgstr "rasipati kamaru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Many games use a waste pile to hold cards taken from the talon. Typically "
"clicking on the talon will cause the topmost card to be flipped face up and "
"placed on the waste pile, at which point the card enters play."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge igre koristite rasipanje kamare da bi zadržale karte preuzete sa "
"Stuba. Obično klikom na Stub će izazvati okretanje karte licem prema gore i "
"staviti je na rasipnu kamaru, koja u tom trenutku ulazi u igru."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid "3. Foundation"
msgstr "3. Temelj"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "foundation"
msgstr "temelj"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The foundation piles are where you want your cards to end up. Typically, the "
"game is one only once all cards have been moved to the foundation piles in "
"the correct order. The number of foundation piles and the ordering required "
"varies from game to game."
msgstr ""
"Temeljne kamare su mjesta gdje želite da vaše karte završe. Tipično, igra je "
"potpuna samo kada su sve karte prešle na temelj kamare u ispravnom "
"redoslijedu. Broj temelja kamara i potrebnih raspodjela varira od igre do "
"igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most games start with the foundation piles empty. Choosing the "
"<guimenuitem>Drop</guimenuitem> action from the menu or toolbar will cause "
"&kpatience; to scan through all the piles move as many cards to the "
"foundation piles as it can. If you have the <guimenuitem>Enabled Autodrop</"
"guimenuitem> setting activated, &kpatience; will attempt to perform a drop "
"whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"Mnoge igre počinju sa praznim temeljima kamara. Birajući "
"<guimenuitem>Izbaci</guimenuitem> akciju iz menija ili alatne trake će "
"izazvati &kpatience; da skenira kroz sve kamare i da prebaci što više karata "
"na temelje kamara. Ako imate <guimenuitem>Omogući Autoizbacivanje</"
"guimenuitem> postavku aktiviranu, &kpatience; će pokušati izbacivati kada "
"god je to moguće."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "4. Playing Piles"
msgstr "4. Igranje kamara"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "playing piles"
msgstr "igranje kamara"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These piles are those where the actual reordering happens. The rules for "
"these piles vary a lot between games. Some show all cards on them, some do "
"not. Some allow only one card to be removed, some allow every card to be "
"removed, &etc;"
msgstr ""
"Ove kamare su one u kojima se događa bitno preslaganje. Pravila za ove "
"kamare se razlikuju između igara. Neke pokazuju sve karte na njima, neke ne. "
"Neke dopuštaju da se samo jedna karta ukloni, neke dopuštaju da se sve karte "
"uklone, &etc;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rules for Individual Games"
msgstr "Pravila za Lične Igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:194
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Klondike</title>"
msgstr "<title>Klondike</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Klondike</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Klondike</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Klondike is the most famous patience &mdash; most likely because it comes "
"with a well-known operating system. It is played with one deck."
msgstr ""
"Klondike je najpoznatiji pasijans &mdash; najvjerojatnije zato što dolazi s "
"poznatim operativnim sistemom. Igra se s jednim špilom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal in Klondike is to put all cards, as real families, ascending on the "
"foundation. This gets easier once all cards are lying face up in the playing "
"piles."
msgstr ""
"Cilj u Klondiku je složiti sve karte, kao prave nizove, uzlazno na "
"temeljima. Biva lakše nakon što su sve karte okrenute licem prema gore u "
"igraćim kamarama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sequences on the playing piles have to be put there in descending order. "
"The cards should alternate in colors (red and black). You can move whole "
"sequences or parts of it, if the first card fits on another pile."
msgstr ""
"Kolone u igraćim kamarama moraju se poredati u silaznom redoslijedu. Karte "
"se trebaju izmjenjivati u bojama (crvene i crne). Možete premjestiti cijele "
"kolone ili dijelove istih, ako prva karta odgovara na drugoj kamari."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On a free pile you can put a king of any color, or a sequence starting with "
"a king."
msgstr ""
"Na praznu kamaru možete staviti kralja bilo koje boje ili kolonu koja "
"počinje sa kraljem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you click on the talon, one card from it will be moved to the waste "
"pile. You can move it to the playing piles or the foundation from there. If "
"the talon is empty, you can move the complete waste pile to the talon by "
"clicking on the empty talon."
msgstr ""
"Kada kliknete na Stub, jedna karta iz njega će biti premještena na rasipnu "
"kamaru. Možete je premjestiti na igraću kamaru ili temelj od tamo. Ako je "
"stub prazan, možete premjestiti kompletanu rasipnu kamaru na Stub klikom na "
"prazan Stub."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can look through the cards on the talon as much as you like."
msgstr "Možete pregledati karte na stubu koliko god želite."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Grandfather</title>"
msgstr "<title>Djed</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Grandfather</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Djed</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This game was introduced to &Paul-Olav.Tvete;, the original developer of "
"&kpatience;, by his grandfather; it is named after this. No other patience "
"games are known to implement this patience game variant."
msgstr ""
"Ova igru je predstavio &Pavla-Olav.Tvete;, izvorni razvojni programer "
"&kpatience;, njegov djed; Ime je dobila po njemu. Nema druge igre pasijansa "
"koja implementira ovakvu verziju pasijans igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In Grandfather, one deck is dealt to seven playing piles. Some cards on each "
"pile are face down on the initial deal."
msgstr ""
"U Djedu, jedan špil se dijeli na sedam igraćih kamara. Neke karte na "
"kamarama su licem prema dolje podijeljene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal is to put all cards as real families ascending on the foundation "
"piles."
msgstr "Cilj je poredati sve karte kao pravi niz uzlazno na temelju kamare."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can move every card on every pile if it fits on another card, to build a "
"real sequence of descending order. For example, you can move the five of "
"spades on top of the six of spades, no matter how many cards on are on top "
"of the five of spades. Just the six of spades has to be on top of its pile."
msgstr ""
"Možete premjestiti svaku kartu na svaku kamaru ako odgovara drugoj karti, "
"izgraditi pravu kolonu silaznim redoslijedom. Na primjer, možete "
"premjestiti  peticu pik na pik šesticu, bez obzira na to koliko je karata "
"iznad pik petice. Samo šestica pik mora biti na vrhu svoje kamare."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On a free pile you can place a king (again no matter how many cards are on "
"top of it)."
msgstr ""
"Na slobodnu kamaru možete postaviti kralja (opet bez obzira na to koliko "
"karta imate na vrhu)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If there are no more possible moves, you can redeal the cards. A redeal "
"consists of picking up the cards from the playing piles (pile by pile, left "
"to right) and redealing them in the starting pattern (zigzagging rows of "
"face down cards forming a peak and then left to right rows of face up cards "
"on top). Note that the cards are <emphasis>not</emphasis> shuffled and that "
"cards on the foundation piles are left untouched. You may redeal no more "
"than twice in a single game."
msgstr ""
"Ako nema više mogućih poteza, možete ponovo dijeliti karte. Ponovno "
"dijeljenje se sastoji od biranja karata iz igraćih kamara (kamara sa kamare, "
"s lijeva na desno) te ponovnog dijeljenja iz početnog uzorka (cik-cak po "
"kolonama s kartama okrenutim prema dolje kreirajući maksimum i potom s "
"lijeva na desno licem prema gore karata na vrhu). Imajte na umu da se karte "
"<emphasis>ne</emphasis> miješaju i da su karte na temelju kamare ostale "
"netaknute. Možete ponovo dijeliti ne više od dva puta u jednoj igri."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Even though the rules are simple and allow many moves, the game is still "
"hard to win. Despite this, or because of it, this game remains a joy to play."
msgstr ""
"Iako su pravila jednostavna i omogućuju mnoge poteze, igra je još uvijek "
"teška za pobijediti. Unatoč tome, ili zbog toga, ova igra ostaje užitak kada "
"se igra."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:275
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Aces Up</title>"
msgstr "<title>Asovi Gore</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Aces Up</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Asovi Gore</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This patience has simple rules, yet is hard to win. It is played with one "
"deck. The goal is to put all cards besides aces onto the foundation. There "
"should be an ace left on every playing pile afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pasijans ima jednostavna pravila, ali i tada je teško pobijediti. Igra "
"se s jednim špilom. Cilj je staviti sve karte pored asova na temelj. Na "
"kraju bi na svakoj igraćoj kamari trebao ostati as."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each top card that is of the same suit (&eg; spades) and has a lower value "
"than another top card (&eg; six of spades and four of spades) can be put on "
"the foundation by clicking on it."
msgstr ""
"Svaka karta koja je na vrhu iste boje (&eg; pikovi) i ima manju vrijednost "
"od one iznad (&eg; šestica i četvorka pik) može biti stavljena na temelj "
"klikom na nju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot move any more cards to the foundation, you can get a new card "
"for each playing pile by clicking on the talon."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možete pomaknuti bilo koju kartu do temelja, možete dobiti novu kartu "
"za svaku igraću kamaru klikom na Stub."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On a free pile you can move every other card on top of a pile. You should "
"use these moves to free piles. That way, new cards can be moved to the "
"foundation."
msgstr ""
"Na slobodnoj kamari možete premjestiti svaku drugu kartu na vrh kamare. "
"Trebali biste koristiti ove poteze da bi oslobodili kamare. Na taj način, "
"nove karte se mogu prebaciti na temelj."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:299 index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "The auto drop feature is disabled in this patience game."
msgstr "Auto izbaci osobina je onemogućena za ovu pasijans igru."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Freecell</title>"
msgstr "<title>Slobodna ćelija</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Freecell</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Slobodna ćelija</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Freecell is played with one card deck. You have four free cells in the top "
"left corner. In addition there are four foundation piles, and eight playing "
"piles below."
msgstr ""
"Slobodna ćelija se igra s jednim špilom. Imate četiri slobodne ćelije u "
"gornjem lijevom uglu. Osim toga tu su i četiri temelj kamare i osam igraćih "
"kamara ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of the game is to have all cards as real families ascending on the "
"foundation. You can achieve this often if you know how to play: Freecell is "
"solvable at a rate of 99.9% approximately &mdash; of the first 32,000 deals "
"there is only one unsolvable (11,982 if you want to know)."
msgstr ""
"Cilj igre je da se sve karte poredaju u prave nizove uzlazno na temeljima. "
"Možete to postići često ako znate kako igrati: Slobodna ćelija je rješiva po "
"stopi od 99,9%, približno &mdash; od prvih 32.000 dijeljenja samo jedno bude "
"nerješeno (11.982, ako želite znati)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the playing piles you have to build descending sequences, where red and "
"black cards alternate. You can put any card in a free cell."
msgstr ""
"U igrajućoj kamari morate izgraditi spuštajuće kolone, gdje se crvene i crne "
"karte izmjenjuju. Možete staviti bilo koju kartu u slobodnu ćeliju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can only move one card that lays on top of a pile or a free cell. "
"Sequences can only be moved if you have enough free space (either free cells "
"or free playing piles) to place the cards."
msgstr ""
"Možete samo premjestiti jednu kartu koja leži na vrhu kamare ili slobodne "
"ćeliji. Kolone mogu biti premještene samo ako imate dovoljno slobodnog "
"prostora (bilo slobodne ćelije ili slobodne igrajuće kamare) da premjestite "
"karte."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "The maximum amount of cards you can move is calculated by:"
msgstr "Maksimalni broj karata koje možete pomaći se računa kao:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "(#{free cells} + 1) * 2<superscript>#{free piles}</superscript>"
msgstr "(#{free cells} + 1) * 2<superscript>#{free piles}</superscript>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To solve this game it is recommended to grab the cards out of the playing "
"sequences in the same order they have to be put into the foundation (first "
"the aces, then the twos, &etc;)"
msgstr ""
"Da biste riješili ovu igru preporučuje se da zgrabite karte od igrajućih "
"kolona u istom poretku u kojem se moraju poredati u temelj (najprije asove, "
"zatim dvojke, &etc;)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should try to keep as many free cells and/or playing piles empty, so you "
"can build sequences as long as possible."
msgstr ""
"Trebali biste pokušati zadržati što više slobodnih ćelija i/ili praznih "
"igrajućih kamara, tako da možete slagati kolone što je moguće duže."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Mod3</title>"
msgstr "<title>Mod3</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Mod3</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Mod3</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Mod3 is played with two card decks. The goal is to put all cards on the top "
"three rows. In those you have to build sequences of the same color. In the "
"first row you have to create the sequence 2-5-8-J, in the second row the "
"sequence 3-6-9-Q, and in the third row the sequence 4-7-10-K. The suit of "
"the cards must be the same in each sequence, so you can only put a five of "
"hearts on top of a two of hearts."
msgstr ""
"Mod3 se igra s dva špila karata. Cilj je poredati sve karte u prva tri reda. "
"U njima morate složiti kolone iste boje. U prvom redu, morate stvoriti "
"slijed 2-5-8-J, u drugom redu kolonu 3-6-9-Q, a u trećem redu kolonu 4-7-10-"
"K. Boja karata mora biti ista u svakoj koloni, tako da možete samo staviti "
"peticu srce na vrh srca dvice."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fourth row is both your waste pile and playing pile. On an empty slot "
"you can put any card from the first three rows, or one from the top of the "
"fourth row."
msgstr ""
"Četvrti red je i vaša rasipna kamara i igrajuća kamara. Na prazano mjesto "
"možete staviti bilo kartu iz prva tri reda, ili jednu s vrha četvrtog reda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:369
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can put aces on the aces piles, on top of the talon. They are in the "
"game so you have a starting point for creating free slots."
msgstr ""
"Možete staviti asove na kamaru asova, na vrhu Stuba. Oni su u igri tako da "
"imate polazište za stvaranje slobodnih praznih mjesta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot move any more cards, you can get new cards on the fourth row "
"by clicking on the talon."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možete pomaknuti bilo koju kartu, možete dobiti nove karte u četvrtom "
"redu klikom na stub."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Gypsy</title>"
msgstr "<title>Cigan</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Gypsy</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Cigan</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Gypsy is played with two card decks. The aim is to put all cards in real "
"families ascending on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Cigan se igra s dva špila. Cilj je poredati sve karte u pravi niz uzlazno na "
"temelju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:392
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The playing piles have to be descending, while red and black cards have to "
"alternate. You can only move sequences or single cards. On a free slot you "
"can put any card or sequence."
msgstr ""
"Igrajuće kamare su spuštajuće, a crvene i crne karte moraju se izmjenjivati. "
"Možete pomicati samo kolone ili pojedinačne karte. Na slobodno mjesto možete "
"staviti bilo koju kartu ili kolonu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you cannot move any more cards, you can click on the talon to get new "
"cards on each playing pile."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možete pomaknuti bilo koju kartu, možete kliknuti na Stub da dobijete "
"nove karte na svakoj igrajućoj kamari."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In using the <guibutton>Undo</guibutton> feature you can ease the game quite "
"a lot, as you have to take many decisions and some of them might turn out to "
"be wrong after you clicked the talon."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći <guibutton>Poništi urađeno</guibutton> osobinu možete olakšati "
"igru poprilično, jer morate donijeti mnoge odluke i neke od njih mogu biti "
"pogrešne pošto kliknete na stub."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Forty &amp; Eight</title>"
msgstr "<title>Četrdeset &amp; Osam</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Forty &amp; Eight</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Četrdeset &amp; Osam</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Forty &amp; Eight is played with two card decks. The goal is to put all "
"cards as real families on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Četrdeset &amp; Osam se igra s dva špila karata. Cilj je poredati sve karte "
"u prave nizove na temeljima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The playing piles have to be descending. Colors are important. You can only "
"put a five of hearts on a six of hearts, for example."
msgstr ""
"Igrajuće kamare moraju bit spuštajuće. Boje su važne. Na primjer, možete "
"samo staviti peticu srce na šesticu srce."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:423
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can only move one card on top of a pile. You can put any card in a free "
"slot."
msgstr ""
"Možete samo premjestiti jednu kartu na vrh kamare. Možete staviti bilo koju "
"kartu u slobodan prostor."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:427
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking on the talon you can put a card on the waste pile; from there "
"you can put it on a playing pile or the foundation (&kpatience; will do this "
"for you). If the talon is empty you can put all cards on the waste pile back "
"on the talon. This works only once: after the second time the talon empties, "
"the game is over."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na Stub možete staviti kartu na rasipnu kamaru; od tamo možete je "
"staviti na igrajuću kamaru ili temelj (&kpatience; će to učiniti za vas). "
"Ako je stub prazan možete staviti sve karte sa rasipne kamare natrag na "
"Stub. To radi samo jednom: nakon drugog puta stub se prazni, igra je gotova."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This patience is difficult to solve. With some experience you can solve many "
"of the deals, especially if you use the <guibutton>Undo</guibutton> feature "
"from time to time to correct your decisions, and the decisions &kpatience; "
"makes in putting cards on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pasijans je težak za riješiti. Uz malo iskustva možete riješiti mnoga "
"dijeljenja, pogotovo ako koristite <guibutton>Poništi urađeno</guibutton> "
"osobinu s vremena na vrijeme kako bi ispravili svoje odluke i odluke "
"&kpatience; kada ste redali karte na temelj."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Simple Simon</title>"
msgstr "<title>Jednostavni Simon</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Simple Simon</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Jednostavni Simon</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simple Simon is played with one card deck. The goal is to put all cards as "
"real families on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Jednostavni Simon se igra s jednim špilom. Cilj je poredati sve karte u "
"prave nizove na temelju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the playing piles you can build sequences. In general you don't have to "
"care about the suits of the cards, but sequences can only be moved if they "
"are part of a real sequence. For example, you can move the six of spades if "
"the five of <emphasis>spades</emphasis> is on top of it, but may not move it "
"if the five of <emphasis>clubs</emphasis> is on top of it."
msgstr ""
"U igrajućim kamarama možete izgraditi kolone. Općenito ne morate brinuti o "
"bojama karata, ali kolone mogu biti premještena samo ako su dio pravog niza. "
"Na primjer, možete premjestiti šesticu pik ako je petica <emphasis>pik</"
"emphasis> na vrhu, ali je ne možete pomaknuti ako je petica <emphasis>tref</"
"emphasis> na vrhu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cards can only be moved to the foundation if all 13 cards of one family "
"lay on top of each other in the playing piles."
msgstr ""
"Karte se mogu pomaći do temelja, ako svih 13 karata jednog niza leže jedna "
"na drugoj u igrajućoj kamari."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:464
#, no-c-format
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "Prijedlog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You should try as soon as possible to move the cards to the correct piles, "
"to create free piles to place cards on temporarily, since you can put any "
"card on those."
msgstr ""
"Trebali biste pokušati što je prije moguće pomaći karte na ispravane kamare, "
"da bi stvorili slobodne kamare na koje ćete staviti karte privremeno, jer "
"možete staviti bilo koju kartu na njih."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With enough free room you can build families on free slots independently of "
"the color. If you have all cards in such families you can sort them by "
"color, so they can be moved to the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Uz dovoljno slobodnog prostora možete izgraditi niz na slobodnim mjestima, "
"neovisno o boji. Ako imate sve karte u takvom nizu možete ih razvrstati po "
"boji, tako da one mogu biti premještene do temelja."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Yukon</title>"
msgstr "<title>Yukon</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Yukon</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Yukon</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yukon is played with one card deck. The goal is to put all cards as real "
"families ascending on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Yukon se igra s jednim špilom. Cilj je poredati sve karte u pravi niz "
"uzlazno na temelju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:486
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The sequences on the playing piles have to be descending with alternating "
"red and black cards. You can move every face up card no matter how many "
"cards are on top of it. So you can put a five of hearts on a six of spades "
"if that one is on top of its pile."
msgstr ""
"Kolona na igrajućoj kamari mora bit spuštajuća s naizmjeničnim crvenim i "
"crnim kartama. Možete premjestiti svaku kartu okrenutu prema gore bez obzira "
"na to koliko na njima ima drugih karata. Dakle, možete staviti peticu srce "
"na šesticu pik, ako je ona na vrhu svoje kamare."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In a free slot you can put a king of any color (again, no matter how many "
"cards are on top of it)."
msgstr ""
"U slobodni prostor možete staviti kralja bilo koje boje (opet, bez obzira na "
"to koliko je karata na njemu)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid "Grandfather's Clock"
msgstr "Djedov sat"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid "Grandfathers Clock"
msgstr "Djedov sat"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Grandfather's clock is a simple patience game. With some experience you "
"should be able to solve most deals. It is played with one card deck. The aim "
"is to put the cards as real ascending sequences on the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Djedov sat je jednostavna igra pasijansa. Uz malo iskustva trebali bi biti u "
"stanju riješiti većinu dijeljenja. Igra se s jednim špilom. Cilj je poredati "
"karte kao pravi niz uzlaznih kolona na temelju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The foundation is on the right-hand side and consists of 12 piles that form "
"the shape of a clock. The nine is at 12 o'clock, the queen is at 3 o'clock, "
"the three is at 6 o'clock and the six is at 9 o'clock."
msgstr ""
"Temelj je na desnoj strani i sastoji se od 12 kamara koje čine oblik sata. "
"Devet je na 12 sati, kraljica je na 3 sata, tri je na 6 sati i šest je na 9 "
"sati."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are 8 playing piles beside the clock and on each are 5 cards. On the "
"playing piles you can build descending sequences. The color of the cards is "
"not important. You can only move one card at a time."
msgstr ""
"Postoji 8 igrajućih kamara pored sata i na svakoj je 5 karata. Na igrajućoj "
"kamari možete izgraditi spuštajuću kolonu. Boja karata nije važna. Možete "
"samo micati jednu kartu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:522
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Golf</title>"
msgstr "<title>Golf</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Golf</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Golf</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:524
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Golf is played with one card deck. The goal of Golf is to move all the cards "
"on the tableau to the foundation."
msgstr ""
"Golf se igra s jednim špilom. Cilj Golfa je premjeriti sve karte sa table do "
"temelja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:527
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The layout of golf solitaire is straightforward. At the beginning of the "
"game you will see the tableau. On it are seven columns each containing five "
"cards. The talon and the foundation are below."
msgstr ""
"Izgled golf pasijansa je jednostavan. Na početku igre ćete vidjeti tablu. Na "
"njoj je sedam kolona koje sadrže pet karata. Stub i temelj su ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Playing golf solitaire is simple, but requires strategy to win. The cards at "
"the base of each column on the tableau are available for play. Available "
"cards are built upon the top foundation card in ascending or descending "
"sequence regardless of suit. If there are no moves available a card may be "
"dealt from the talon to the foundation. The game is over when all the cards "
"in the talon have been dealt and there are no more possible moves."
msgstr ""
"Igrati golf pasijans je jednostavano, ali zahtijeva strategiju za pobjedu. "
"Karte u podnožju svake kolone na tabli su dostupne za igru. Dostupne karte "
"su postavljene na vrh temelja karata u uzlaznim ili silaznim slijedovima bez "
"obzira na boju. Ako nema dostupnih poteza karte se mogu dijeliti sa Stuba na "
"temelj. Igra je gotova kada se sve karte sa Stuba podijele i nema više "
"mogućih poteza."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Spider</title>"
msgstr "<title>Pauk</title>"

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Spider</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>Pauk</primary>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:542
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Spider is played with two card decks. The cards are dealt out into 10 "
"playing piles, 4 of 6 cards and 6 of 5 cards each. This leaves 50 cards that "
"can be dealt out 10 at a time, one on each playing pile."
msgstr ""
"Pauk se igra s dva špila karata. Karte se dijele na 10 igraćih kamara, 4 od "
"6 karata i 6 od 5 karata. To ostavlja 50 karata koje se mogu dijeliti po 10 "
"u isto vrijeme, na svaku od igraćih kamara."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the playing piles, a card can be placed on another card of any suit and "
"of one higher value. A sequence of descending cards of the same suit may be "
"moved from one playing pile to another."
msgstr ""
"U igraćim kamarama, karta se može staviti na drugu kartu bilo koje boje i "
"veće vrijednosti. Kolona spuštajućih karata iste boje može biti premještena "
"s jedne igrajuće kamare na drugu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:554
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The goal of spider is to put all cards as real families descending from "
"Kings anywhere in the playing piles. When such a family is built in a "
"playing pile, it is removed to the lower-left corner of the window."
msgstr ""
"Cilj pauka je poredati sve karte u pravi spuštajući niz Kraljeva bilo gdje u "
"igrajućoj kamari. Kad je takav niz složen u igrajućoj kamari, biva sklonjen "
"u donji lijevi ugao prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The different levels determine how many suits are dealt - Easy uses 1 suit, "
"Medium uses 2 suits, and Hard uses all 4 suits. The game is fairly easy to "
"win at Easy level, and very difficult to win at Hard level."
msgstr ""
"Različiti nivoi određuju koliko se boja dijeli - Lahko koristi 1 boju, "
"Srednje koristi 2 boje, a Teško koristi sve 4 boje. Igra je prilično "
"jednostavna za pobijediti na Lahkom nivou, a vrlo je teška za pobijediti na "
"Teškom nivou."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:572
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "Pregled Sučelja"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Game Menu"
msgstr "Meni igre"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:578
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>N</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Game...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>N</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Nova igra...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Return to the game selection screen.</action> This action abandons "
"the deal in progress."
msgstr ""
"<action>Vratiti se na ekran izbora igre.</action> Ova akcija napušta "
"trenutno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Deal</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novo Dijeljenje</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Start a new deal of the same game type.</action> This action "
"abandons the deal in progress."
msgstr ""
"<action>Počni novo dijeljenje istog tipa igre.</action> Ova akcija napušta "
"trenutno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:594
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>New Numbered Deal...</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>D</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novo Brojano Dijeljenje...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:600
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Start a new deal by specifying the game type and deal number.</"
"action> This action abandons the deal in progress."
msgstr ""
"<action>Počni novo dijeljenje navodeći vrstu igre i broj dijeljenja. </"
"action> Ova akcija napušta trenutno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:601
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpatience; gives each deal a unique indentifying number (which it uses "
"internally to randomize the deck during the initial deal). This feature "
"allows you to replay a deal of interest or to attempt a particularly "
"difficult deal recommended by a friend. Especially dedicated players may "
"wish to \"beat\" &kpatience; by playing all 2147483647 deals consecutively "
"for each of the game types."
msgstr ""
"&kpatience; daje svakom dijeljenju jedinstveni identifikaciji broj (koji "
"koristi interno za miješanje špila tokom početnog dijeljenja). Ova opcija "
"vam omogućava da ponovite važno dijeljenje ili da pokušate posebno teško "
"dijeljenje preporučeno od prijatelja. Posebno posvećeni igrači će poželjeti "
"da \"pobijede\" &kpatience; redom igrajući svih 2147483647 dijeljenja za "
"svaku vrstu igre."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that for Freecell, &kpatience;'s deal numbers match those described in "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.solitairelaboratory.com/fcfaq.html\">the Freecell "
"FAQ</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Obratite pažnju da Slobodne ćelije, &kpatience; dijele brojeve opisane na "
"<ulink url=\"http://www.solitairelaboratory.com/fcfaq.html\">the Freecell "
"FAQ</ulink>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:606
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F5</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Restart Deal</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F5</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Ponovo pokreni Dijeljenje</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:611
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return the current game to its initially dealt condition."
msgstr "Vraća trenutnu igru u njeno prvobitno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:614
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Load...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Učitaj...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:619
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Load a saved game.</action> This action abandons the deal in "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"<action>Učitaj spašenu igru.</action> Ova akcija napušta trenutno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Load Recent</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>List of recently accessed files.</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Učitaj Nedavno</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Lista nedavno korištenih datoteka.</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>List recently accessed save files in order of last use.</action> "
"Selecting a game will load it. This action abandons the deal in progress."
msgstr ""
"<action>Prelistajte nedavno korištene spašene datoteke da bi našli zadnje "
"korištenje.</action> Odabirom igre ona će se ućitati. Ova akcija napušta "
"trenutno dijeljenje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:630
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Spasiti kao...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:635
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save the current game to disk."
msgstr "Spasi trenutnu igru na disk."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:638
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Statistics</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Statistike</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Display various statistics about your performance broken down by game type."
msgstr "Prikaz raznih statistika o vašem učinku u ovisnosti od tipa igre."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:645
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Igra</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Napustiti</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quit</action> &kappname;."
msgstr "<action>Napustiti</action> &kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Move Menu"
msgstr "Pokretni Meni"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Poništiti urađeno</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:663
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Undo</action> your last move."
msgstr "<action>Poništiti urađeno</action> vaš zadnji potez."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:666
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Ponoviti "
"urađeno</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:671
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Redo</action> the move that was just undone by <guimenuitem>Undo</"
"guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"<action>Ponoviti urađeno</action> potez koji je poništen od strane Poništiti "
"urađeno <guimenuitem>Poništiti urađeno</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:674
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Savjet</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Provide some hints as to possible moves, should the player become stuck. "
"Cards that can be legally moved to another pile are temporarily highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Ponuditi neke savjete o mogućim potezima, u slučaju da igrač zaglavi. Karte "
"koje se mogu po pravilima pomaći na drugu kamaru su privremeno istaknute."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:682
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>D</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Demo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>D</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Demo</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Start the demo mode.</action> While in demo mode, &kpatience; "
"attempts to solve the deal for you. Activate this action a second time to "
"exit demo mode."
msgstr ""
"<action>Poćnite demo mod.</action> Dok ste u demo modu, &kpatience; pokušava "
"riješiti dijeljenje za vas. Aktivirajte ovu akciju po drugi put da bi izašli "
"iz demo moda."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:690
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Space</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Draw</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Prostor</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Nacrtati</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:695
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Flip one of more cards from the talon and move them to the waste "
"pile.</action> This action is available in only certain games."
msgstr ""
"<action>Uzmite jednu od karata s stuba i pomaknite je na igraću kamaru.</"
"action> Ova aktivnost je moguća samo u određenim igrama."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Return</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Deal Row</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Vratiti</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Dijeli Red</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:703
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Flip several cards from the talon and place one on each playing pile."
"</action> This action is available in only certain games."
msgstr ""
"<action>Uzmite nekoliko karata s stuba i pomaknite po jednu na svaku od "
"igrajućih kamara.</action> Ova aktivnost je moguća samo u određenim igrama."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:706
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>R</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Redeal</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>R</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Pomaći</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Ponovo dijeli</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:711
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Collect all the card left in play and redeal them without shuffling."
"</action> This action is available in only certain games."
msgstr ""
"<action>Skupi sve karte ostavljene u igri i ponovo ih dijeli bez miješanja.</"
"action> Ova aktivnost je moguća u samo određenim igrama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "Meni Postavki"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:719
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>\"Game Type\" Options</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>List of game type specific options.</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guisubmenu>\"Tip Igre\" Opcije</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Lista specifičnih opcija igre.</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>List options specific to the current game type.</action> This menu "
"is available in only certain games (Klondike and Spider)."
msgstr ""
"<action>Lista opcije specifične za trenutni tip igre.</action> Ovaj meni je "
"dostupan samo u određenim igrama (Klondike i Pauk)."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:727
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Stack Options</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Face Down (harder)/Face Up (easier)</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Složi Opcije</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Licem Dolje (teže)/Licem Gore (lakše)</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:732
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Allows you to choose if the card faces should be shown.</action> "
"This menu is available in Spider only."
msgstr ""
"<action>Omogućava vam da izaberete hoće li biti pokazano lice karte.</"
"action> Ovaj meni je moguć samo u Pauku."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Change Appearance...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Promijeniti Izgled...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open a dialog to change the card deck and game theme used."
msgstr "Otvorite dijalog za promjenu špila karata i teme igre koja se koristi."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:743
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enable Autodrop</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Omogući Autodijeljenje</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable automatically moving cards to the foundation piles when possible."
msgstr ""
"Omogućite automatsko pomicanje karata do temelja kamara kada je to moguće."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:750
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Enable Solver</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Omogući Razriješivač</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Enable the automatic solving engine.</action> When enabled, the "
"solver will constantly try to determine whether the current game state is "
"winnable. You may wish to disable the solver to conserve processor or "
"battery usage."
msgstr ""
"<action>Omogući pogon automatskog razriješavanja.</action> Kada je omogućen, "
"razriješivač će stalno pokušavati da odredi da li se trenutna igra može "
"pobijediti. Možda ćete željeti onemogućiti razriješivač da bi uštedili "
"resurse procesora i baterije."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:757
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Remember State on Exit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zapamti Stanje i Izađi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:761
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Enable automatic saving of the game state when &kpatience; is shut "
"down.</action> If enabled, &kpatience; will load the previous game state "
"automatically the next time it is started."
msgstr ""
"<action>Omogući automatsko spašavanje stanja igre kada je &kpatience; ugašen."
"</action> Ako je omogućen, &kpatience; će automatski učitati prethodno "
"stanje igre sljedeći put kada se pokrene."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:764
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pokaži Alatnu traku</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:768
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show or hide the toolbar."
msgstr "Pokaži ili sakrij alatnu traku."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:771
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show Statusbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Pokaži Status traku</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:775
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show or hide the statusbar."
msgstr "Pokaži ili sakrij status traku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:780
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Help Menu"
msgstr "Meni Pomoći"

#. Tag: sect1
#: index.docbook:780
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:785
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:790
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:791
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can change the faces and backs of the playing cards and the game theme. "
"To do so please use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Change Appearance...</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""
"Možete promijeniti lica i poleđine karata s kojima se igra i temu. Da bi to "
"uradili molimo vas da koristite <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycap>F10</keycap></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Promijeni Izgled...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> na meni traci."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:798
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:799
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No, &kappname; features no keyboard only play. However, most menu options do "
"have keyboard shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Ne, &kappname; ne podržava igranje samo na tastaturi. Međutim, puno meni "
"opcija ima kratice na tastaturi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid "Even with hints I still have no clue how to play. Help!"
msgstr "Čak i sa savjetima nemam pojma kako igrati. Pomoć!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:803
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Besides the <quote>Hint</quote> feature there also is a useful <quote>Demo</"
"quote> mode, where the built-in artificial intelligence will play the game "
"for you. You can try to watch and learn. However, if you have any questions "
"it is better to read the <link linkend=\"howto\">How to Play</link> and "
"<link linkend=\"rules_and_tips\">Game Rules, Strategies and Tips</link> "
"sections of this handbook."
msgstr ""
"Pored <quote>Savjet</quote> osobine također je koristan <quote>Demo</quote> "
"mod, gdje će umjetna inteligencija igrati umjesto vas. Tako da možete "
"gledati i učiti. Međutim, ako imate još pitanja najbolje je da pročitate "
"<link linkend=\"howto\">Kako se Igra</link> i <link linkend=\"rules_and_tips"
"\">Pravila Igre, Strategije i Savjeti</link> odjeljak ovog priručnika."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:808
#, no-c-format
msgid "Credits and License"
